## 6. Sensitivity & Escalation Rules

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Composite Score Computed] --> B{Family has<br/>dual-relationship flag?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Auto-exclude flagged candidate<br/>in Layer 1, no scoring needed]
    B -- No --> D{PI hold flag<br/>on family record?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Pause auto-assignment<br/>Route to PI for manual decision]
    D -- No --> F[Proceed with Layer 2 scoring<br/>and auto-confirm]
```

This mirrors the real workflow where Jessica Bradshaw explicitly paused finalizing a day/time for the twins' family until the dual-relationship issue was resolved manually.

