| `family_continuity_flag` | family_id, sigma (+1/-1), preferred_candidate_id | Sets \( \sigma_{fam} \), optional hard override |
| `scoring_weights` | w1, w2, w3, w4, w5, effective_date | PI-controlled configuration, versioned |

